{"sections":[{"slug":"复定向上同调理论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"复定向上同调理论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">复定向上同调理论</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“复定向上同调理论”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/广义上同调中的定向","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">广义上同调中的定向</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于环谱</span> $E$, <span lang=\"zh\">称其复可定向是指</span> $E^2(\\mathbb{C}P^\\infty)\\to E^2(S^2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为满射</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">其定向是</span> $E^2(\\mathbb{C}P^\\infty)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span>.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的定向是第一</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">环谱</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">的定向给出一个同构</span> $E^*(\\mathbb CP^\\infty)\\simeq E^*(*)[t](t.md)$. <span lang=\"zh\">由此可以定义</span> $E$-<span lang=\"zh\">值第一陈类</span> $c_1^E=t$. $E$-<span lang=\"zh\">值第一陈类与线丛的张量积满足</span>\n$$\r\nc_1^E(L\\otimes L') \\simeq f(c_1^EL,c_1^E L'),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">为交换环</span> $R=E^{\\text{even}}(*)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/形式群律","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">形式群律</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">另外</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">此时</span> $t$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathbb{C}P^\\infty$ <span lang=\"zh\">上万有线丛的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Thom类","text":"Thom <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>$R$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的形式群律等同于</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}R$ <span lang=\"zh\">到形式群律模叠</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}L/G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的映射</span>.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th><span lang=\"zh\">谱</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">上同调理论</span>)</th><th>$\\operatorname{Spec}L/G$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的拟凝聚层</span></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><span lang=\"zh\">环谱</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">乘性上同调理论</span>)</td><td>$\\operatorname{Spec}L/G$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的仿射概形</span></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/KO","text":"KO"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">不是复定向上同调理论</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}